1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 15]</font>

15
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you fall?</font>

16
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you out of your mind?</font>

17
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop laughing.</font>

18
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't me. It was Xia.</font>

19
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly, you...</font>

20
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What Xia?</font>

21
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw it was you.</font>

22
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quiet.</font>

23
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it so creepy?</font>

24
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a dying man.</font>

25
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to fear?</font>

26
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you going to eat that peach?</font>

27
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

28
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

29
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the Chief?</font>

30
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over there.</font>

31
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

32
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

33
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

34
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

35
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No longer keeping watch
at Shangxue Academy's gate?</font>

36
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to terms with it.</font>

37
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

38
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came looking for you on purpose.</font>

39
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come to terms with it?</font>

40
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you sought me out especially?</font>

41
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

42
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak your mind.</font>

43
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

44
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you mentioned the other day</font>

45
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that a student from Shangxue Academy</font>

46
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drowned by accident,
and no one took the case.</font>

47
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take it.</font>

48
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't come to terms with it.</font>

49
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You took this case
just to get into the academy</font>

50
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and see Li Congyao, right?</font>

51
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing escapes you, Chief.</font>

52
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since he won't come out,</font>

53
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go in and find him.</font>

54
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the same either way.</font>

55
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd appreciate your help, Chief.</font>

56
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please assign this case to me.</font>

57
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

58
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not?</font>

59
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you want me</font>

60
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to handle cases?</font>

61
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've changed my mind.</font>

62
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given your current physical condition,</font>

63
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think you can take it.</font>

64
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back and rest.</font>

65
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

66
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please entrust this case to me.</font>

67
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will handle it well</font>

68
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and won't disgrace us.</font>

69
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that I won't help you.</font>

70
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have already transferred this case</font>

71
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the Ministry of Justice.</font>

72
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover, the victim in this case</font>

73
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the son of Mr. Cui Zhan,</font>

74
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Councillor of the Ministry of Revenue.</font>

75
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

76
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To the Ministry of Justice.</font>

77
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me.</font>

78
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

79
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that one day,</font>

80
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd see you guys take back a case.</font>

81
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just look at the body.</font>

82
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't damage it.</font>

83
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

84
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have trouble explaining it.</font>

85
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

86
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough with the chatter.</font>

87
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Miao.</font>

88
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui awaits you in the front hall.</font>

89
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

90
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Tell him I'll be right there.
- Yes.</font>

91
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Go on, examine it.</font>

92
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Return the body soon.</font>

93
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well?</font>

94
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any findings?</font>

95
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's fluid in the lungs.</font>

96
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The face is pale.</font>

97
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Foam around the mouth and nose.</font>

98
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's obviously</font>

99
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a death by drowning.</font>

100
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that the same result
Miao Youxin got?</font>

101
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

102
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When was Cui Tai pulled from the well?</font>

103
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The day after the Shangsi Festival.</font>

104
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Autopsy Records]
Mr. Cui,</font>

105
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">based on the autopsy findings,</font>

106
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your son's cause of death was</font>

107
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drowning.</font>

108
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There were no signs
of struggle or a fight.</font>

109
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can be concluded</font>

110
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he lost his footing</font>

111
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fell into the well.</font>

112
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is one more thing.</font>

113
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The coroner found traces
of a hallucinogenic drug</font>

114
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your son's nostrils.</font>

115
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From this, we can deduce</font>

116
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that after inhaling some hallucinogens,</font>

117
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wandered in a daze</font>

118
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fell into the well
in the Scholar's Grove.</font>

119
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son did not go to the Grove alone.</font>

120
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was taken there by force.</font>

121
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

122
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this case is already closed.</font>

123
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's nonsense.</font>

124
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her speak.</font>

125
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son was taken to the Scholar's Grove?</font>

126
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui,</font>

127
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I took the liberty
of examining the body.</font>

128
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The mouth and limbs
showed no abnormalities.</font>

129
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But his clothing was suspicious.</font>

130
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As far as I know,</font>

131
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the day he died,</font>

132
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a heavy rain fell on the city.</font>

133
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he had walked to the grove himself,</font>

134
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his shoes would be caked with mud.</font>

135
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But please look here.</font>

136
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This pair belongs to your son,</font>

137
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">found beside the well.</font>

138
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The soles have only a little dust,</font>

139
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nothing more.</font>

140
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Obviously,</font>

141
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone led him to that location.</font>

142
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just as I suspected.</font>

143
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is your name?</font>

144
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui, I'm Jun Qinglan,</font>

145
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a coroner from the Court</font>

146
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Judicial Review.</font>

147
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

148
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From this day forward,</font>

149
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am entrusting my son's case</font>

150
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

151
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two will work on it together.</font>

152
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should you have any questions,</font>

153
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may seek my assistance.</font>

154
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I obey your command.</font>

155
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

156
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

157
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

158
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I won't give it.</font>

159
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I trouble you with a question?</font>

160
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Prince Duan teaching today?</font>

161
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What business do you have with him?</font>

162
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're old acquaintances.</font>

163
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard he was ill.</font>

164
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to see if he's improved.</font>

165
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Old acquaintances? Please.</font>

166
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do you think you're going?</font>

167
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you that coroner</font>

168
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan threw out of his mansion?</font>

169
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's slander against an official.</font>

170
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to be imprisoned?</font>

171
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so scared.</font>

172
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's hilarious.</font>

173
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please cooperate with our investigation.</font>

174
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our eyes,</font>

175
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you guys</font>

176
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are worth nothing.</font>

177
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely nothing.</font>

178
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only those from prestigious families</font>

179
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may enter the Shangxue Academy.</font>

180
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you know what's good for you,
get lost.</font>

181
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got some nerve, kid.</font>

182
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems a lesson is in order,</font>

183
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you'll respect our work.</font>

184
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Threatening us.</font>

185
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Threatening us with violence.</font>

186
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

187
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shangxue Academy is a place of peace,</font>

188
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dedicated to scholarly pursuits.</font>

189
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We tolerate no outsiders
causing trouble here.</font>

190
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

191
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ah, forgive me.</font>

192
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should address you as Master now.</font>

193
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

194
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are here on official orders,</font>

195
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">investigating Cui Tai's drowning.</font>

196
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui Tai was a student here,</font>

197
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we must question his fellow students.</font>

198
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

199
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you obstructing our investigation?</font>

200
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An official decree.</font>

201
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

202
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're treating us like criminals?</font>

203
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not worthy.</font>

204
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

205
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even so,
you must not disturb the students.</font>

206
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait outside.</font>

207
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back after the students
finish their lesson.</font>

208
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He looks fine;</font>

209
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his illness seems to be improving.</font>

210
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we'll return later.</font>

211
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you'll cooperate fully then.</font>

212
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

213
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go to the Chancellor first.</font>

214
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something else has just come up.</font>

215
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find you in a while.</font>

216
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

217
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a woman.
What's there to be so proud of?</font>

218
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk too much.</font>

219
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, I was wrong.</font>

220
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, let go.</font>

221
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After class,</font>

222
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">clean the school grounds.</font>

223
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's not spotless,</font>

224
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may not leave.</font>

225
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Master.</font>

226
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

227
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time for class.</font>

228
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

229
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

230
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Prince Duan</font>

231
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is quite fond of the little coroner.</font>

232
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they are here
to investigate Cui Tai's death,</font>

233
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we could be in serious trouble.</font>

234
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we must ensure</font>

235
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they never dare show
their faces here again.</font>

236
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

237
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is where Cui Tai
fell into the well.</font>

238
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for leading the way,
Chancellor.</font>

239
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a functioning well.</font>

240
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is correct.</font>

241
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This used to be
where students read at dawn.</font>

242
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, due to some incidents,</font>

243
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was sealed off.</font>

244
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Cui Tai</font>

245
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have any close friends</font>

246
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">among the students?</font>

247
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui holds a high position,</font>

248
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so Cui Tai was naturally quite popular.</font>

249
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

250
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he got along well with everyone.</font>

251
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Chancellor.</font>

252
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I may, I'd like to take a walk</font>

253
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around here.</font>

254
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I shall take my leave.</font>

255
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

256
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan asked me
to bring you a message,</font>

257
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">telling you to wait</font>

258
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for him in the storage room
at Shangxue Academy.</font>

259
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

260
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to have a word with you.</font>

261
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know why Qinglan</font>

262
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">took Cui Tai's case?</font>

263
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you just defend</font>

264
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that student who did wrong?</font>

265
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As his teacher,</font>

266
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">am I not allowed to defend</font>

267
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my own student?</font>

268
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does Qinglan even mean to you?</font>

269
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She followed you all the way here.</font>

270
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She lost her appetite,</font>

271
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">worrying only about your illness.</font>

272
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this how you treat her?</font>

273
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As her superior,</font>

274
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should keep her in check,</font>

275
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not let her run wild like this.</font>

276
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

277
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I failed to discipline her.</font>

278
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies, Prince Duan.</font>

279
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,
I'll keep a close eye on her,</font>

280
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">protect her well,</font>

281
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make her forget you completely.</font>

282
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Suit yourself.</font>

283
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tricked me into coming here.</font>

284
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kid.</font>

285
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How arrogant.</font>

286
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you cause trouble here</font>

287
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before you hear
of the Three Young Masters</font>

288
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Shangxue Academy?</font>

289
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

290
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We agreed to meet here.</font>

291
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is she?</font>

292
00:11:55,960 --> 00:12:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xia Bohou, Bai Junting, Liu Cheng]</font>

293
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

294
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan is missing.</font>

295
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear she's in danger.</font>

296
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's split up and search.</font>

297
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Agreed.</font>

298
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want from me?</font>

299
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we want?</font>

300
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just want to teach you some manners.</font>

301
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't get another chance</font>

302
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cause trouble here.</font>

303
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood?</font>

304
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no quarrel with you,</font>

305
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you made such a big scene.</font>

306
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be that you've done
something wrong,</font>

307
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you fear I might find out?</font>

308
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen here, you little brat.</font>

309
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't flatter yourself.</font>

310
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What would I have to fear from you?</font>

311
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't teach you a lesson today,</font>

312
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't know who you're dealing with.</font>

313
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

314
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jia.</font>

315
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get her!</font>

316
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help! Fire!</font>

317
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She even knows what to shout.</font>

318
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I must teach you a proper lesson.</font>

319
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu, get her!</font>

320
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, take this.</font>

321
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

322
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I clash with any stick I see.</font>

323
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just looking at a stick makes me dizzy.</font>

324
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

325
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's your chance.</font>

326
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take her down.</font>

327
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm scared.</font>

328
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai, hurry, hurry up.</font>

329
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, quick.</font>

330
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

331
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, kid.</font>

332
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't hold this against me.</font>

333
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

334
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

335
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm really going to do it.</font>

336
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

337
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you knock him out?</font>

338
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the only son
of Vice Commissioner Xia.</font>

339
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

340
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are in serious trouble now.</font>

341
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia, wake up.</font>

342
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, they're just a bunch of blockheads.</font>

343
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

344
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia, please wake up.</font>

345
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

346
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

347
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

348
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

349
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You reaped</font>

350
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what you sowed.</font>

351
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up. This is all your fault.</font>

352
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth.</font>

353
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Xia.
- Xia.</font>

354
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who should really shut up?</font>

355
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me.</font>

356
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

357
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you seen Xia Bohou and the others?</font>

358
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems they went
toward the storage room.</font>

359
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

360
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence.</font>

361
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now,</font>

362
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">am I still a kid?</font>

363
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun!</font>

364
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, help!</font>

365
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

366
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This little coroner is inhuman!</font>

367
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You know what?
- Master, save me!</font>

368
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She just tricked us into coming here.</font>

369
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Shangxue Academy!</font>

370
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

371
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how did you find this place?</font>

372
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan said you went missing.</font>

373
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He asked for my help.</font>

374
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I recalled</font>

375
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your earlier clash with three students,</font>

376
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and as I pondered,</font>

377
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I simply ended up here.</font>

378
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, in such a frantic rush,</font>

379
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were you worried about me?</font>

380
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worried about my students.</font>

381
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what do you</font>

382
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">plan to do with those three?</font>

383
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all, they're scions
of official families.</font>

384
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're unharmed.</font>

385
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't press the matter further.</font>

386
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's consider today's incident settled.</font>

387
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you come here</font>

388
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to recover?</font>

389
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't concern yourself.</font>

390
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shangxue Academy is no place for you.</font>

391
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave at once.</font>

392
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I took your divorce letter,</font>

393
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I became nothing to you.</font>

394
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's none of your business.</font>

395
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How ungrateful.</font>

396
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

397
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

398
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all right?</font>

399
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see.</font>

400
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you hurt anywhere?</font>

401
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

402
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly happened here?</font>

403
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a student prank.</font>

404
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go</font>

405
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and teach them</font>

406
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a lesson for you.</font>

407
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

408
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They all come from powerful families.</font>

409
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's better to let it go</font>

410
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than stir up trouble.</font>

411
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you put it that way,</font>

412
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't my background</font>

413
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seem even more formidable?</font>

414
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

415
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop investigating this case.</font>

416
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's illness</font>

417
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be nearly healed by now.</font>

418
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop trying to check...</font>

419
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

420
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's call it a day.</font>

421
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

422
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I went to see Prince Duan just now,</font>

423
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was practicing calligraphy.</font>

424
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's actually in good health.</font>

425
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Protect Jun Qinglan.</font>

426
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

427
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

428
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The punishment's gone on long enough.</font>

429
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The three of us</font>

430
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have been at Shangxue Academy</font>

431
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for over ten years now.</font>

432
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if newcomers see us like this?</font>

433
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to save some face.</font>

434
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, our bodies
can't take it anymore.</font>

435
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just look at me.</font>

436
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Xia here.</font>

437
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look what's become of him.</font>

438
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It truly pains me to see it.</font>

439
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

440
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And anyway, Li,</font>

441
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who do you think you are?</font>

442
00:16:45,640 --> 00:16:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father...</font>

443
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, I was wrong.</font>

444
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That stuff.</font>

445
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can smell it.</font>

446
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I smell it too.</font>

447
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu, are you hiding it?</font>

448
00:17:16,050 --> 00:17:17,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

449
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

450
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

451
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

452
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:32,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

453
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:37,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

454
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:41,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

455
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:47,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

456
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:54,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

457
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

458
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

459
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:06,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

460
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:11,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

461
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:15,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
